flowchart TD
    Launch[Launch or check again] --> Read[Bounded background reads]
    Read --> CLI{Supported CLI?}
    CLI -->|No or unknown| Required[Required CLI card]
    Required --> Launch
    CLI -->|Yes| Cards[Ordered setup cards]
    Cards -->|Missing or skipped| Unknown[Unresolved evidence]
    Cards -->|Explicit Run| Safe[Fixed daemon action]
    Safe --> Read
    Cards -->|Admin command| Terminal[Copy or terminal handoff]
    Terminal --> Enter[Show command; wait Enter]
    Enter --> Fresh[Check again or regain focus]
    Fresh --> Read
    Cards -->|Continue| Projects[Project view]
